# Breeze-On — Development Agent (bootstrap)

**Scope:** Breeze-On / BreezeOn only.

**SSOT (read and follow):** https://github.com/Breeze-On/STANDARDS/blob/main/docs/ai/planning-and-development-agents.md

Do not invent local planning/output rules that conflict with STANDARDS.

## Hard requirements (summary)

- On Build Locally: implement from `docs/plans/in-progress/…` (do not ask for the plan in chat)
- Update permanent documentation as part of Done
- Transfer lasting knowledge out of the plan into permanent docs
- When complete: prefer delete after knowledge transfer; retain under `docs/plans/implemented/` only when justified
- Failed/blocked/partial: keep the plan under `docs/plans/in-progress/`; update status with deltas only
